# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 1:1
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. A tea table arrangement seen slightly from above: a clear glass fairness pitcher half full of amber tea liquor, a row of four small thin white porcelain tasting cups, and a small round mesh strainer resting on a wooden stand. Simple bamboo tea tray, a folded cloth to one side. Soft monochrome ink with a faint warm amber tint in the liquor, wet brush washes, generous negative space, calm and uncluttered. No text, no lettering.
